      "id": "claim_00f2c000f12d4bd2b42b509291da2f4e",
      "statement": "GET /api/articles/{id}/extracted-content (ArticleController.extractedContent -> ArticleExtractionService.extract) implements Reader View: it 404s on an unknown article, 400s when the article has no URL, fetches the original page via FeedFetcher (reusing its SSRF guard, size cap and User-Agent), decodes bytes with jsoup, and extracts readable content with Readability4J, caching the result verbatim in article.extracted_content so later requests skip re-fetching.",
